Write a Python program to create a linked list and display its elements.
CODE-:
class Node:
	def __init__(self, data):
    	self.data = data
    	self.next = None
 
# Create nodes
n1 = Node(10)
n2 = Node(20)
n3 = Node(30)
 
# Connect nodes
n1.next = n2
n2.next = n3
 
# Display linked list
current = n1
 
while current:
	print(current.data)
	current = current.next
	
output-:
10
20
30



